# signature is unchanged and the injection grew one hunk.
#
# The injection restores both pre-fix rules: a tombstone is revived by mere
# existence at the recorded path, and a snapshot entry is admitted by
# `starts_with(project_root)` with no session-directory authority, no traversal
# check, and no file-identity check.
